# Optional — enables Icon786 Free AI for all users (search + generate).
# Copy to backend/.env for local dev, then restart the backend.
#
# OpenAI:
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-your-openai-key
#
# Hugging Face (hf_... keys auto-route to HF API):
# HUGGINGFACE_API_KEY=hf_your-token-here
#
# Also accepted: AI_API_KEY, HF_TOKEN
#
# Without a server key, AI Search still works (basic keyword matching).
# AI Generate requires either this file or your own key in browser AI settings.
